# Temple Grounds 06_temple_sacredpath L0: CFishCloud e00340081 (animated, repel 1, ball priority 1, the
# attractor e00340143 follows it), e00340014 (animated, repel 1), e0034011c (animated, repel 0, ball
# priority 0). God-mode player stands in each cloud, shoots it, morphs and boosts inside 0081; the
# attractor is activated twice (insert, then found), deactivated twice (found, then not found), reactivated
# and deleted; the spawned morph state is set while in 0081 (Touch's spawned-morph arm).
